{"id":"0218073c8db43619","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-rule.md","title":"GL Rule","display":"df-gl-rule — GL Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-rule","aliases":["89-df-gl-rule"],"display":"df-gl-rule — GL Rule","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-rule — GL Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is the set of finite premise\nsequences over <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{MP}},\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{Nec}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{MP}},\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{Nec}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是下述分别定义的分离规则与必然化规则关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Nec}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Nec}\\)</span> 为规则名称下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\langle A,A\\to B\\rangle,B)\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{Nec}}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\langle A\\rangle,\\Box A)\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}\\cup\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{Nec}},\\\\\n\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L}\n&amp;\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\langle A,A\\to B\\rangle,B)\\mid\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{Nec}}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\langle A\\rangle,\\Box A)\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{MP}}\\cup\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{Nec}},\\\\\n\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L}\n&amp;\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Löb 模式属于公理集；GL 的原始推理规则只有 MP 与 Nec。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","